<[len] NMORGENSTERN> Carl, do you have any questions?
<[len] NMORGENSTERN> Do you know the difference between DO and ?DO   ???
<[len] NMORGENSTERN> The difference happens when the two indices are equal.
<[len] NMORGENSTERN> Thus 0 0 DO ..... LOOP  will execute 32K times
<[len] NMORGENSTERN> whereas 0 0 ?DO . . . LOOP will execute 0 times.
<[len] NMORGENSTERN> Otherwise they act the same.
<[len] NMORGENSTERN> How is the weather in Pasadena?
